{"id":"rideau","lemma":"rideau","pos":"noun","rank":3568,"glosses":["curtain (woven fabric to cover, e.g., windows)","blind (cover for windows)","curtain, veil (something keeping another in secret)"],"ipa":"/ʁi.do/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/3c/Fr-rideau.ogg/Fr-rideau.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"rideaux"},"formAudio":{"rideaux":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/53/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-rideaux.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Qui se cache derrière le rideau ?","en":"Who's hiding behind the curtain?","words":[{"g":"who"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to hide","l":"cacher"},{"g":"behind"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"Peux-tu fermer les rideaux ?","en":"Can you close the drapes?","words":[{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to shut"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null]},{"text":"Le rideau est tombé.","en":"The curtain fell.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"to fall","l":"tomber"}]},{"text":"Ferme les rideaux, s'il te plaît.","en":"Please close the curtains.","words":[{"g":"to shut","l":"fermer"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null,{"g":"oneself / if"},{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to please","l":"plaire"}]},{"text":"Est-ce que je peux ouvrir le rideau ?","en":"Can I open the curtain?","words":[{"g":"is","l":"être"},null,null,{"g":"I"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"to open"},{"g":"the / it"},null],"phrases":[[1,3,"what"]]}]}